> > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > Comparing these two null models the second one seems to perform better, but the both get some pretty ominous warnings (which i dont get without the random intercepts). And of course when I write more complex models I get similar warnings. If anyone has any experience with this stuff and would be willing to chat with me about it I would be happy to buy you a coffee or beer or something, thanks!
